        "item_Pic48A": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What card sizes fit in the case?",
            "content": "<p>Our phone cases support <strong>all trading cards</strong>, including but not limited to:</p><ul><li>Pokémon</li><li>Magic: The Gathering (MTG)</li><li>Yu-Gi-Oh!</li><li>One Piece</li><li>Sports cards (excluding jersey patch/thick cards)</li><li>Dragon Ball Z / Score (DBZ)</li><li>Lorcana</li><li>Gundam</li><li>K-pop photo cards</li><li>Polaroids and other similarly sized cards</li></ul><p>Each case includes <strong>3x side loaders and sleeves</strong> that allow you to safely display cards of different sizes.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_tpdHPK": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How is my card protected?",
            "content": "<p>Each card is protected using multiple layers:</p><ol><li>Sleeve</li><li>Side loader or top loader</li><li>Secure internal compartment within the phone case</li></ol><p>The card is sandwiched between the phone and the case, providing excellent protection from bending, debris, and daily handling.</p><p>Our side loaders and sleeves include <strong>UV-protective additives</strong>. Additionally, the case’s patent-pending internal locking design provides <strong>water resistance</strong>, helping protect the card in everyday environments on the exterior.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_H6EawD": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What UV protection does the case provide?",
            "content": "<p>The included side loaders and top loaders feature <strong>UV-protected materials</strong> designed to reduce UV exposure over time.</p><p>While no product can completely eliminate UV exposure, these materials help slow fading and discoloration. For maximum protection, we recommend rotating displayed cards periodically and avoiding prolonged direct sunlight.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_9cwyBy": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you ship internationally?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, we ship worldwide.</p><h4>Fast processing less than 48h</h4><h4>No Surprise Fees</h4>"
          }
        }
